OL,3,GNEWSAFootball Association welcomes 3G  
OL,4,Apitch proposal                         
OL,6,FA football association has welcomed    
OL,7,Fplans for a new full-size 3G football  
OL,8,Fpitch.                                 
OL,10,FDeputy Chris Rebindaine lodged the     
OL,11,Fproposal as an amendment to the Jersey 
OL,12,Fgovernment's 2027`2030 budget,         
OL,13,Frecommending #600,000 is allocated to  
OL,14,Fthe development.                       
OL,16,FAccording to the amendment, the pitch  
OL,17,Fwould "increase capacity, reduce       
OL,18,Ffixture cancellations, support         
OL,19,Fparticipation across all age groups    
OL,20,F[...] protect existing grass pitches   
OL,21,Fand deliver wider community benefits". 
