OL,3,GNEWSAFootball Association welcomes 3G  
OL,4,Apitch proposal                         
OL,6,FJersey FA chairman Jimmy Kelly said the
OL,7,Fproposal addressed a lack of year-round
OL,8,Ffacilities - a challenge he said local 
OL,9,Fand affiliated clubs had "faced for    
OL,10,Fmany years".                           
